@yaroslavros, just two minor issues:
* could you provide a link to the NSS patch (and its discussion) please?
* could you put somewhere in the code the exact version of draft-ietf-tls-ech-keylogfile that you implemented? I know that it should be 01, but it might be useful to keep track of it, especially if in the future we have some kind of "incompatible" changes...

